  <p class="lede"><strong>Bold Beauty. No Fluff.</strong> Beauty Strikes is an independent beauty editorial focused on Korean skincare, practical routines, haircare and beauty tools.</p>

  <h2>Our philosophy</h2>
  <p>Beauty marketing is loud. We aim to be clear instead. We explain what a product type is for, what its key ingredients are known to do, and where the evidence runs out. Short routines that you'll actually keep beat elaborate ones you'll abandon.</p>

  <h2>Editorial standards</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>No fake reviews or testimonials.</strong> We don't publish invented customer quotes, star ratings or review counts.</li>
    <li><strong>No invented testing.</strong> We only say we have tried or tested a product when that is true, and we say how. Most of our product notes are based on publicly available information: official ingredient lists, brand documentation and published research.</li>
    <li><strong>No live prices.</strong> We don't show prices or stock levels. They change constantly; the retailer’s page is the only reliable source.</li>
    <li><strong>Evidence-conscious language.</strong> We avoid words like "cures", "miracle" or "clinically proven" unless we can link to the evidence.</li>
    <li><strong>Not medical advice.</strong> Our guides are general information. Skin conditions belong with a dermatologist.</li>
    <li><strong>Corrections.</strong> Each product shows a “last reviewed” date. When information changes, we update it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How products are selected</h2>
  <p>A product makes our shortlist when we can clearly explain who it suits and why: its formula, its format, and its fit within a simple routine. We also note limitations — for example fragrance, texture or price tier. Brands cannot pay to be included.</p>
  <p>Products marked <em>Placeholder</em> are sample slots used while the site is being set up. They are not recommendations.</p>

  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>Beauty Strikes may earn a commission through affiliate links, at no extra cost to you. Affiliate relationships never decide what we recommend. Read our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact & legal</h2>
  <p>Legal information and contact details are published in our <a href="https://sites.google.com/view/skinstrike-legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legal Notice / Impressum ↗</a>.</p>
